WEBVTT

00:02.170 --> 00:06.440
According to the Water Dragon, the barrier
is being controlled from that lighthouse.

00:06.730 --> 00:10.900
We have no choice but to restore it
to regroup with the others.

00:11.240 --> 00:13.880
We must let them dock
as soon as possible.

00:15.740 --> 00:18.400
There don't seem to be any problems
with the status, but...

00:21.090 --> 00:24.979
No matter what we do,
it looks like we can't approach land.

00:24.980 --> 00:25.899
Yes.

00:25.900 --> 00:28.200
I wonder if everyone's alright...

00:28.530 --> 00:29.880
Master Naofumi...

00:30.320 --> 00:33.009
Didn't Raph-chan say they were safe too?

00:33.010 --> 00:37.250
I'm not worried! I'm only frustrated
that I can't be by his side.

00:42.350 --> 00:43.700
Where's Naofumi?

00:49.550 --> 00:50.990
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:51.760 --> 00:53.250
How do I look?

00:53.620 --> 00:54.930
It suits you well.

00:56.320 --> 00:58.200
With that, you can cover your face too.

00:59.400 --> 01:03.319
Raphtalia, make sure you absolutely
don't let your tail or ears show.

01:03.320 --> 01:04.110
Yes.

01:04.920 --> 01:06.669
What is this?

01:06.670 --> 01:10.170
That's proof of the Water Dragon's blessing.

01:10.540 --> 01:13.829
To the people of this country,
it's an object of worship.

01:13.830 --> 01:15.890
So it's something sacred?

01:16.900 --> 01:19.390
If you're done changing, let's go.

01:20.850 --> 01:24.130
We need to fix the barrier quickly.

01:33.360 --> 01:36.080
THE RISING OF THE SHIELD HERO SEASON 4

02:55.910 --> 02:56.819
EPISODE 7: LANDING IN Q'TEN LO

02:56.820 --> 02:59.019
EPISODE 7: LANDING IN Q'TEN LO
What a beautiful view.

02:59.020 --> 03:02.279
At night, the Sakura Lumina
glow and serve as illumination,

03:02.280 --> 03:05.500
and they're also used as an energy
source for various tools.

03:06.000 --> 03:09.229
If we brought some back,
could we make use of them?

03:09.230 --> 03:12.959
It seems the trees will only
grow within Q'ten Lo.

03:12.960 --> 03:14.380
I see.

03:15.320 --> 03:16.840
Are they fishing too?

03:17.360 --> 03:19.370
Looks like they're harvesting seaweed.

03:19.800 --> 03:22.949
Things would be quicker
if we flew straight over there.

03:22.950 --> 03:25.160
It'd be troublesome
if we got shot down.

03:25.520 --> 03:27.870
To be safe, we'll go by land.

03:33.630 --> 03:34.940
How should I put it...

03:35.240 --> 03:37.939
It feels like a Japanese-style Raphtalia Land.

03:37.940 --> 03:39.410
What is that supposed to mean?

03:39.720 --> 03:42.399
They're enshrining the clan
of the Heavenly Emperor.

03:42.400 --> 03:44.910
So it's a family that's deeply revered.

03:45.510 --> 03:50.910
And yet, my father and mother
had to leave Q'ten Lo.

03:51.520 --> 03:52.270
Huh?

03:57.040 --> 03:57.760
What's that?

04:02.030 --> 04:02.969
Master Naofumi.

04:02.970 --> 04:03.479
Yeah.

04:03.480 --> 04:04.119
Hold it.

04:04.120 --> 04:05.039
What?

04:05.040 --> 04:06.500
You go, Gaelion.

04:07.330 --> 04:09.440
You two just stay still.

04:15.410 --> 04:16.680
Can you stand?

04:21.240 --> 04:22.400
H-Hey!

04:22.830 --> 04:24.220
What's wrong with him?

04:24.640 --> 04:26.329
Y-You people...

04:26.330 --> 04:27.979
What have you done...?

04:27.980 --> 04:30.400
Aren't you afraid of the government officials??

04:36.480 --> 04:39.299
You're the ones who killed
that monster, aren't you?

04:39.300 --> 04:41.479
We were just trying
to save that child...

04:41.480 --> 04:46.500
It was just that a nearby monster
happened to eat another one.

04:47.560 --> 04:49.269
Nonsense!

04:49.270 --> 04:50.940
Do you dare defy the Heavenly Emperor?!

04:51.220 --> 04:52.340
Of course not.

04:52.750 --> 04:57.320
A wise official like yourself should know
what kind of creature this is, right?

04:57.730 --> 04:59.220
The vassal of the Water Dragon...!

05:00.680 --> 05:02.280
Our apologies!

05:03.920 --> 05:06.209
Who are those people...?

05:06.210 --> 05:08.160
Could they be emissaries of the Water Dragon?

05:08.540 --> 05:10.549
I didn't expect things
to turn out like this.

05:10.550 --> 05:11.190
Huh?

05:11.570 --> 05:14.250
Magnificent, young ladies!

05:16.020 --> 05:18.769
While everyone else was too afraid
of the mandate to act,

05:18.770 --> 05:21.380
you rose up for the sake of a poor child!

05:21.870 --> 05:24.889
If a child is being attacked,
of course you help them.

05:24.890 --> 05:28.640
I'm so moved, I've fallen in love! My lady!

05:28.920 --> 05:29.600
What?

05:30.070 --> 05:33.979
Please allow me, Muramasa,
to treat you to a cup of tea.

05:33.980 --> 05:36.659
Um, we really didn't do anything...

05:36.660 --> 05:39.439
Sorry, but we're in a bit of a hurry.

05:39.440 --> 05:41.999
Such beauty!

05:42.000 --> 05:45.530
Please, at least let me treat you to one cup!

05:45.890 --> 05:49.040
He's so shameless.
Is he Motoyasu No. 2?

05:49.550 --> 05:50.679
Thank you.

05:50.680 --> 05:55.459
But I already have feelings for someone else,
so I can't return your feelings.

05:55.460 --> 05:57.300
Please, don't say that...

05:57.840 --> 05:59.190
Zweite Thunder Bolt.

06:01.600 --> 06:03.770
What a tomboyish girl...

06:04.200 --> 06:04.890
Ah...

06:05.440 --> 06:08.839
That turned into quite the commotion.
Let's move on for now.

06:08.840 --> 06:10.100
Yeah.

06:10.510 --> 06:11.879
We should hurry.

06:11.880 --> 06:13.089
Let's do that.

06:13.090 --> 06:15.120
What an odd person.

06:19.330 --> 06:21.480
What's this "mandate" about?

06:21.900 --> 06:26.649
It seems the current Heavenly Emperor
has forbidden killing living creatures,

06:26.650 --> 06:28.239
including monsters.

06:28.240 --> 06:29.330
Huh?

06:29.700 --> 06:32.699
So it's like the "Edicts on Compassion
for Living Things," huh?

06:32.700 --> 06:34.950
Edicts on Compassion for Living Things?

06:35.430 --> 06:37.920
I'm glad Gaelion is with us.

06:39.100 --> 06:43.170
So if a monster kills another monster,
they can't punish anyone, right?

06:43.650 --> 06:47.610
If the owner had controlled them,
then the owner would have been punished.

06:48.060 --> 06:51.059
But if it's the Water Dragon's vassal,
no one can lay a hand on it.

06:51.060 --> 06:54.770
So that means you made good use
of the Water Dragon's mark.

06:57.170 --> 06:58.190
That means...

06:58.760 --> 07:00.900
People here can't even fish, can they?

07:01.190 --> 07:02.650
Yeah.

07:03.130 --> 07:05.349
That's why the fishermen
were gathering seaweed.

07:05.350 --> 07:06.720
Please wait!

07:07.160 --> 07:09.159
If you take that away,
then how will we...!

07:09.160 --> 07:12.790
Anyone who can't pay taxes
is no different from a traitor!

07:14.160 --> 07:16.419
But if I can't even fish either...

07:16.420 --> 07:19.210
Do you dare defy
the Heavenly Emperor's will?!

07:25.960 --> 07:27.150
No, Raphtalia.

07:28.580 --> 07:31.379
This situation might actually
work in our favor.

07:31.380 --> 07:32.040
Eh?

07:32.480 --> 07:36.380
There must be plenty of citizens
who are unhappy with this mandate.

07:38.440 --> 07:39.269
What is it?

07:39.270 --> 07:40.620
Someone's there.

07:45.490 --> 07:46.829
Is he an official?

07:46.830 --> 07:47.820
Not sure.

07:48.560 --> 07:50.689
Once we turn the corner,
use concealment magic.

07:50.690 --> 07:51.360
Yes.

08:00.610 --> 08:04.670
I am not your enemy!

08:05.080 --> 08:08.380
I heard from the sea folk of
the Water Dragon's message

08:08.710 --> 08:11.890
and have come here to welcome you!

08:12.670 --> 08:15.560
Please, would you at least hear me out?

08:15.930 --> 08:16.840
Raphtalia.

08:17.700 --> 08:21.360
It's too much of a coincidence
to be a made-up story.

08:21.640 --> 08:22.370
Hey.

08:23.640 --> 08:25.320
Stand up.

08:28.050 --> 08:29.249
Umm...

08:29.250 --> 08:32.489
First, tell us who you are
and what your purpose is.

08:32.490 --> 08:35.939
I am Luminus, the son of Raluva,
the mayor of this—

08:35.940 --> 08:37.729
Make it simpler.

08:37.730 --> 08:38.960
But...

08:39.480 --> 08:42.420
I'd prefer if you speak normally too.

08:42.760 --> 08:43.810
Then...

08:44.450 --> 08:47.920
We would like to ask
to lend your strength.

08:48.600 --> 08:50.050
Why us?

08:50.620 --> 08:54.390
Surely you've seen the current
state of this country.

08:54.670 --> 08:56.890
You mean that order about
not killing living things?

08:57.290 --> 09:01.350
On top of that, heavy taxes have been imposed,
and people are collapsing in the streets.

09:01.960 --> 09:05.640
We can no longer turn a blind eye
to such corrupt rule.

09:06.180 --> 09:09.240
So you're among those dissatisfied
with the Heavenly Emperor.

09:09.600 --> 09:12.570
I can explain the details at the manor.

09:13.130 --> 09:15.200
Might I trouble you to come with me?

09:15.710 --> 09:18.059
I think we should hear
what he wants to say.

09:18.060 --> 09:19.290
Yes.

09:19.730 --> 09:22.419
Don't even think of trying to trap us.

09:22.420 --> 09:24.729
N-Never!

09:24.730 --> 09:28.090
If any disgrace occurs,
I will take my own life to apologize.

09:28.800 --> 09:33.090
THE RISING OF THE SHIELD HERO SEASON 4

09:33.380 --> 09:35.430
I am the mayor of this town.

09:36.340 --> 09:37.900
My name is Raluva.

09:38.450 --> 09:41.520
Would you mind showing me your face?

09:45.460 --> 09:48.070
You really resemble your father.

09:48.380 --> 09:50.150
You knew my father?

09:51.060 --> 09:53.110
He was of great help to me.

09:53.560 --> 09:57.079
You were the one who was
with Raphtalia's father, right?

09:57.080 --> 10:00.909
And you must be the Water Dragon's former
miko priestess. It has been a long time.

10:00.910 --> 10:04.120
I am Naofumi Iwatani,
the Shield Hero.

10:04.470 --> 10:06.089
I know of you.

10:06.090 --> 10:11.630
We are all deeply grateful for how you have
protected Lady Raphtalia until now.

10:12.240 --> 10:16.159
For a nation in isolation, you seem
to know quite a lot about the outside.

10:16.160 --> 10:19.259
This is a town where trade takes place.

10:19.260 --> 10:20.600
I see.

10:20.860 --> 10:24.560
So then, what do you mean
by wanting our help?

10:26.520 --> 10:28.359
To end this rotten government,

10:28.360 --> 10:31.820
we wish for Lady Raphtalia to take
the position of Heavenly Emperor.

10:32.120 --> 10:35.080
Heavenly Emperor?! Me?

10:35.470 --> 10:40.890
We came to this country only to settle things
with those who are after Raphtalia's life.

10:41.320 --> 10:43.830
Once that is done,
we intend to leave.

10:44.870 --> 10:46.330
I understand.

10:46.690 --> 10:48.090
You don't oppose this?

10:48.520 --> 10:50.479
To become nothing more
than a puppet of power

10:50.480 --> 10:54.740
like the current Heavenly Emperor
is not the true way.

10:55.280 --> 11:00.100
The Heavenly Emperor is meant to
exist for this world, for the people.

11:00.440 --> 11:03.980
That was also your father's belief.

11:05.530 --> 11:09.940
So that's why my father
left this country?

11:10.250 --> 11:12.060
That was not the only reason.

11:12.500 --> 11:17.020
At that time, there was a vile struggle over
who would be the next Heavenly Emperor.

11:26.500 --> 11:31.549
Had he remained,
he would have met a cruel end.

11:31.550 --> 11:32.760
And so...

11:33.620 --> 11:36.349
We have been waiting all this time.

11:36.350 --> 11:39.199
For the day when the true
Heavenly Emperor would appear

11:39.200 --> 11:42.720
to break this deadlock and restore
the world to its rightful state.

11:43.940 --> 11:45.680
What is your plan?

11:46.160 --> 11:49.639
First, we wish to depose the officials
who control the barrier

11:49.640 --> 11:51.960
and then to raise the signal of revolt.

11:52.420 --> 11:54.900
I believe it will also be to your benefit.

11:55.330 --> 11:56.650
Do you have soldiers?

11:56.970 --> 12:02.620
My clan and the townsfolk
are prepared to rise up.

12:02.900 --> 12:03.960
Alright.

12:06.490 --> 12:07.790
Master Naofumi?

12:08.390 --> 12:10.970
Raphtalia. Wear your miko's outfit.

12:11.750 --> 12:13.319
Again?!

12:13.320 --> 12:14.710
But that means...

12:17.520 --> 12:18.430
Here.

12:19.360 --> 12:21.949
Do you realize what it means
if I wear that miko outfit?

12:21.950 --> 12:24.409
Either way, we're already being targeted.

12:24.410 --> 12:26.559
It's wiser to gain more allies.

12:26.560 --> 12:28.339
I know that, but still...

12:28.340 --> 12:32.820
We need to deal with the barrier quickly
if we're to reunite with Itsuki and the others.

12:33.220 --> 12:34.840
Besides, look.

12:35.930 --> 12:39.610
Look at their eyes.
They've been yearning for this.

12:39.960 --> 12:41.930
They wished for a revolt.

12:42.650 --> 12:44.280
I'll help too.

12:53.420 --> 12:55.190
U-Umm...

12:55.540 --> 12:57.880
MIKO OUTFIT OF THE WATER DRAGON

12:58.520 --> 13:02.059
O Heavenly Emperor! Please guide us!

13:02.060 --> 13:05.730
We will all risk our lives to serve you!

13:07.190 --> 13:09.180
Proud people of Q'ten Lo!

13:11.250 --> 13:13.400
The true Heavenly Emperor has returned!

13:13.690 --> 13:16.650
Now is the time to put an end
to this rotten government!

13:17.020 --> 13:19.900
The true Heavenly Emperor will guide you!

13:20.390 --> 13:22.839
For the sake of the world,
for the sake of the people!

13:22.840 --> 13:25.260
Those who wish that, come with us!

13:30.520 --> 13:34.639
Master Naofumi,
you motivated them just like Atla.

13:34.640 --> 13:36.599
You really managed to fire them up.

13:36.600 --> 13:39.109
I'm getting excited too.

13:39.110 --> 13:43.430
We'll take the lead.
I don't want needless casualties.

13:44.910 --> 13:46.080
I understand.

13:46.550 --> 13:49.550
If it can't be avoided,
then we can only move forward.

13:55.840 --> 14:00.030
Stop! This is sacred ground ruled
by the Heavenly Emperor!

14:00.310 --> 14:04.530
Tell your leader that the true
Heavenly Emperor has come to speak.

14:05.180 --> 14:09.329
So you're the false Heavenly Emperor
and the bearer of an evil Spirit Implement!

14:09.330 --> 14:11.399
There is no need to talk with traitors!

14:11.400 --> 14:13.350
Slay them!

14:15.010 --> 14:17.020
Well, that's about what I expected.

14:17.510 --> 14:18.560
Let's go!

14:22.720 --> 14:24.180
Shooting Star Shield!

14:24.630 --> 14:28.010
The Spirit Implement of yours
has no effect on us!

14:31.900 --> 14:33.349
Curse you! A blinding attack?!

14:33.350 --> 14:35.829
We've made our own preparations too!

14:35.830 --> 14:37.720
All Zweite Aura!

14:38.450 --> 14:39.349
Raphtalia!

14:39.350 --> 14:40.180
Yes!

14:44.850 --> 14:46.739
Follow the true Heavenly Emperor!

14:46.740 --> 14:48.330
Yes, Dad!

14:53.270 --> 14:54.819
We'll take them all at once!

14:54.820 --> 14:55.660
Yes!

15:00.560 --> 15:01.840
So this is the lighthouse.

15:02.510 --> 15:04.470
If we put out that light up there...

15:06.340 --> 15:07.680
What are you doing?!

15:08.280 --> 15:12.180
Eliminate that impostor
Heavenly Emperor at once!

15:12.610 --> 15:14.519
That one's the boss?

15:14.520 --> 15:15.940
It would seem so.

15:17.060 --> 15:19.360
You dare to impersonate
the Heavenly Emperor!

15:19.620 --> 15:22.669
Now behold the power of me, Bearga,

15:22.670 --> 15:25.670
blessed by the true Heavenly Emperor!

15:29.620 --> 15:30.459
What?

15:30.460 --> 15:31.509
This is...

15:31.510 --> 15:35.460
Naofumi's blessing seems to
have been nullified somehow.

15:36.420 --> 15:39.529
That's... the Sakura Stone of Destiny!

15:39.530 --> 15:41.209
It weakens the Spirit Implements

15:41.210 --> 15:45.340
while boosting the strength of those
blessed by the Heavenly Emperor!

15:45.800 --> 15:48.720
That thing is way too
specialized against Heroes!

15:49.030 --> 15:50.430
Here I come!

15:55.910 --> 15:57.250
Zweite Aura!

15:58.210 --> 16:00.149
My Hero's magic has been sealed too?!

16:00.150 --> 16:03.540
Finish off these traitors!

16:04.860 --> 16:07.399
As the source of thy power,
I command thee...

16:07.400 --> 16:13.490
Decipher the laws of nature
and let thunder strike my foes!

16:14.090 --> 16:16.500
All Drifa Chain Lightning!

16:19.610 --> 16:24.559
No matter what happens,
I'll protect Raphtalia and Naofumi.

16:24.560 --> 16:27.550
Don't forget about me either.

16:33.550 --> 16:36.519
You're the priestess of carnage!

16:36.520 --> 16:39.560
Do you dare oppose us with
those defiled hands of yours?!

16:39.850 --> 16:43.230
Yes. I'll start by giving you
a taste of that carnage.

16:45.030 --> 16:46.479
What do we do?

16:46.480 --> 16:47.949
Die!

16:47.950 --> 16:51.979
False Heavenly Emperor and bearers
of wicked Spirit Implements!

16:51.980 --> 16:54.259
Drifa Aqua Slash!

16:54.260 --> 16:56.220
Drifa Rock Blast!

16:58.330 --> 16:59.720
Sadeena!

17:01.450 --> 17:03.790
You come up with the strangest ideas, Naofumi!

17:07.610 --> 17:11.259
You're stronger than expected.
But this is as far as you go.

17:11.260 --> 17:15.969
O Heavenly Emperor,
we shall carry out the proxy mediator.

17:15.970 --> 17:20.440
We shall transform all of ourselves
into a blade, and we will bestow

17:20.750 --> 17:23.770
the fate of annihilation upon these fools!

17:24.160 --> 17:24.980
No way...

17:25.240 --> 17:28.360
Astral Enchant!

17:33.240 --> 17:34.449
This is...!

17:34.450 --> 17:37.540
With this, the battle is decided!

17:39.470 --> 17:41.610
Is that all you've got?!

17:43.420 --> 17:45.039
What is that power?!

17:45.040 --> 17:47.110
Astral Enchant...

17:47.490 --> 17:50.389
It's a special spell that gathers
the strength of others blessed

17:50.390 --> 17:53.059
by the Heavenly Emperor into the one

17:53.060 --> 17:55.220
who has received a high-level blessing.

17:58.120 --> 17:59.810
Their life force is being shared?

18:03.340 --> 18:05.320
Big sister Sadeena! Gaelion!

18:10.980 --> 18:14.490
So this is the extent of a false
Heavenly Emperor's power!

18:15.310 --> 18:18.369
This is nothing!

18:18.370 --> 18:20.330
Still act strong, huh?

18:20.910 --> 18:22.360
Use this!

18:24.680 --> 18:25.539
What?

18:25.540 --> 18:26.439
WEAPON COMBINE - ACTIVATED

18:26.440 --> 18:29.099
SAKURA STONE OF DESTINY SHIELD

18:29.100 --> 18:31.509
Sakura Stone of Destiny Shield?

18:31.510 --> 18:32.919
With that,

18:32.920 --> 18:37.260
even inside the Sakura Stone of Destiny's
barrier, your abilities should increase too.

18:37.590 --> 18:38.760
You...!

18:39.090 --> 18:41.379
You traitor!

18:41.380 --> 18:44.140
Why would you lend strength
to the false Heavenly Emperor?!

18:44.460 --> 18:47.059
Traitor? Don't be ridiculous.

18:47.060 --> 18:50.150
I've always been
on the side of pretty girls!

18:51.650 --> 18:53.669
I don't fully get it,

18:53.670 --> 18:55.110
but I'll put it to use!

18:55.740 --> 18:56.950
WOULD YOU LIKE TO USE THIS SKILL?

18:58.090 --> 18:59.910
My power is coming back!

19:00.960 --> 19:01.909
With this...!

19:01.910 --> 19:05.119
Please do your best, young ladies!

19:05.120 --> 19:08.089
You insolent fools!

19:08.090 --> 19:11.300
Sakura Destiny Sphere! Attack Support!

19:15.180 --> 19:16.299
Raphtalia!

19:16.300 --> 19:17.059
Yes!

19:17.060 --> 19:19.930
Kagura Dance of Sakura:
First Formation: Blossom!

19:23.360 --> 19:24.609
Gaelion.

19:24.610 --> 19:26.519
Touch that Sakura Lumina!

19:26.520 --> 19:28.360
You're so rough!

19:33.790 --> 19:36.110
The power of Sakura Stone of Destiny...!

19:36.600 --> 19:38.369
We have control of the barrier!

19:38.370 --> 19:39.189
Great!

19:39.190 --> 19:40.120
Now!

19:40.410 --> 19:46.039
Like pure flowing waters, let our intentions
wash away hatred, resentment,

19:46.040 --> 19:48.770
and the curse upon this land.

19:49.320 --> 19:52.120
Dragon Vein, grant us a miracle here!

19:52.760 --> 19:56.119
I, Gaelion, command the heavens and earth!

19:56.120 --> 20:00.060
Transect the way of the universe and rejoin
it again to expel the pus from within!

20:00.600 --> 20:06.300
Power of mine! Awaken the strength to
terminate the foolish adherents before me!

20:07.020 --> 20:09.860
Blossomlight Maelstrom of the Water Dragon!

20:13.130 --> 20:16.430
Supreme Ultimate: Slash of Destiny!

20:17.080 --> 20:18.779
Not yet...!

20:18.780 --> 20:20.990
No... This is already over.

20:28.870 --> 20:31.330
We did it!

20:46.220 --> 20:48.820
Master!

20:49.640 --> 20:51.189
Master Naofumi!

20:51.190 --> 20:53.399
Looks like everyone's safe.

20:53.400 --> 20:55.509
We finally managed to regroup.

20:55.510 --> 20:56.320
Yeah.

20:59.320 --> 21:01.479
Master!

21:01.480 --> 21:04.080
Master Naofumi!
Forgive me for being late!

21:06.700 --> 21:07.939
S'yne?

21:07.940 --> 21:09.789
You teleported here?

21:09.790 --> 21:12.290
She said she just couldn't sit still.

21:13.390 --> 21:14.879
I'm glad...

21:14.880 --> 21:18.509
You can't just hug him first!
That's cheating!

21:18.510 --> 21:20.569
What are you two doing?

21:20.570 --> 21:23.059
Hey, hey, is this a harem or what?

21:23.060 --> 21:24.220
No.

21:25.180 --> 21:27.279
Anyway, I'm just glad you're safe.

21:27.280 --> 21:27.810
Wait...

21:28.200 --> 21:29.400
Master?!

21:30.520 --> 21:30.979
Huh?

21:30.980 --> 21:35.229
Hmm? Oh, Erhard!
Long time no see.

21:35.230 --> 21:37.689
No way... this guy is...?!

21:37.690 --> 21:38.939
Yeah, that's right.

21:38.940 --> 21:42.889
You must be tired from the voyage.
Come, have some tea over there.

21:42.890 --> 21:44.660
I refuse!

21:45.170 --> 21:48.509
He's even more of a womanizer
than the rumors said...

21:48.510 --> 21:51.799
Thanks to that, he seems
to have joined our side.

21:51.800 --> 21:55.420
Now that everyone's here,
shall we have a victory feast?

21:57.950 --> 22:00.399
Don't leave me behind!

22:00.400 --> 22:04.380
Hey! Young ladies!

23:36.310 --> 23:40.920
#7 BIG SNAKE
